      en: ["Located in the SNNPR region of southern Ethiopia.", "Situated near the UNESCO-recognized Konso cultural landscape.", "Geography consists of hilly terrain and semi-arid plains.", "Elevation ranges between 1,500 and 2,000 meters above sea level.", "The region is famous for its ancient stone-walled agricultural terraces.", "Traditional home to the Konso and Gidole ethnic groups."],
